WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.374
Jason: It's my turn to hold Chatter.

2
00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:19.254
Alexia: I'm next.

3
00:00:19.255 --> 00:00:21.738
Kristen: I want to hold Chatter too!

4
00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:28.248
Chatter: Hurry up! Hello! Good-bye!

5
00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:31.162
Alexia: Can I take Chatter's picture?

6
00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:36.599
Kristen: I want his picture too!

7
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:41.223
Skyler: Ouch! Chatter tried to nip my ear!

8
00:00:41.224 --> 00:00:48.389
The crowd is making him cranky.

9
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:54.247
Riley: There's Mr. Lin, the pet shop owner.

10
00:00:54.248 --> 00:00:56.806
Mr. Lin: I'm here to take your picture too.

11
00:00:56.807 --> 00:01:02.314
Mr. Lin: I'm going to put it in the store window.

12
00:01:02.315 --> 00:01:05.519
Riley: Chatter fell asleep.

13
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:09.102
Chatter: Good night! Go to bed!

14
00:01:09.103 --> 00:01:12.479
Mr. Lin: Everyone, look over here!

15
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.189
Ben: Speedy won't come out of his shell.

16
00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:20.528
He's shy because of all the people.

17
00:01:20.529 --> 00:01:25.342
Theo: Whiskers is scared of crowds too.

18
00:01:25.343 --> 00:01:30.101
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

19
00:01:30.102 --> 00:01:35.051
Riley: Snooks wants to go home. He's hungry!

20
00:01:35.052 --> 00:01:38.479
Skyler: I wish our club wasn't famous anymore!

21
00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:49.182
Ben: Me too.

22
00:01:49.183 --> 00:01:53.137
Theo: Tomorrow we have a special program at school.

23
00:01:53.138 --> 00:01:57.035
Riley: A magician is coming!

24
00:01:57.036 --> 00:01:59.869
Skyler: I heard he can make someone disappear.

25
00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:05.429
Theo: Creepy!

26
00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:08.096
Riley: The magician was great!

27
00:02:08.097 --> 00:02:12.329
Sarah: He made Kristen disappear for a whole minute!

28
00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:15.763
Ben: Everyone forgot all about the Pet Lovers Club.

29
00:02:15.764 --> 00:02:18.862
Skyler: I'm so glad.

30
00:02:18.863 --> 00:02:22.864
Ben: Me too. Speedy doesn't like crowds!

31
00:02:22.865 --> 00:02:26.138
Theo: Neither does Whiskers.

32
00:02:26.139 --> 00:02:29.448
Sarah: Hey! Remember Skyler's wish?

33
00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:32.993
Sarah: She wished that we weren't famous anymore!

34
00:02:32.994 --> 00:02:35.403
Skyler: Yep. And now we're not.

35
00:02:35.404 --> 00:02:38.407
Theo: Thank goodness!

36
00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:41.484
Sarah: Maybe the key is magic!

37
00:02:41.485 --> 00:02:44.245
Riley: I don't think so, Sarah.

38
00:02:44.246 --> 00:02:50.705
But it's fun to pretend!
